QuestGuidance.Register("en",404,{
[12897]="7002FE13\n1\tDefeat mounted uruks on the road to Thornhope (total: 6)\tMounted uruks can be found on the Road to Thornhope. Holenmal has asked that you clear mounted uruks from the Road to Thornhope.\n2\tTalk to Holenmal at Eaworth\tHolenmal is at Eaworth. Holenmal is waiting to speak with you about your victories along the road to Thornhope.\n",
[12898]="700333EB\n1\tTalk to Master Elrond at the Last Homely House in Rivendell\tMaster Elrond is at the Last Homely House in Rivendell. Gandalf has sent you to speak with Master Elrond regarding the troubles in the East.\n2\tTalk to Glorfindel in Rivendell\030Talk to Legolas at the guest house in Rivendell\030Talk to Boromir at the guest house in Rivendell\tGlorfindel is near the stream outside of the Last Homely House. Legolas and Boromir are at the Guest Houses in Rivendell. Master Elrond suggested you speak with his guests Glorfindel, Legolas, and Boromir as to the whereabouts and dealings of the friends and enemies that participated in the great battle at the Lonely Mountain.\n3\tComplete Iorbar's Peak scaling instance\030Complete Seat of the Great Goblin scaling instance\030Complete Webs of the Scuttledells scaling instance\tYou should gather your allies and undertake the quests set upon you by Glorfindel, Legolas, and Boromir. Glorfindel wishes for you to rescue an eagle egg from the stone-giants of the Misty Mountains. Legolas has asked you to find Thranduil's scouts in the Scuttledells. Boromir suggests you invade Goblin-town and deal with the new Great Goblin.\n4\tTalk to Master Elrond at the Last Homely House in Rivendell\tMaster Elrond is at the Last Homely House in Rivendell. You should return to Master Elrond with news of your successes.\n5\tWait until Master Elrond summons you again\tWait for Elrond to summon you.\n6\tTalk to Elrond at the Last Homely House in Rivendell\tMaster Elrond is at the Last Homely House in Rivendell. You should return to Master Elrond for further instructions.\n7\tTalk to Gimli\tGimli is in the Guest House in Rivendell. Elrond asked you to speak with Gimli regarding the emissary of the Dark Lord who came to Erebor.\n8\tComplete The Bells of Dale instance\tYou should gather your allies and undertake Gimli's quests to aid Dale and the Lonely Mountain.\n9\tYou should gather your allies and undertake Gimli's quests to aid Dale and the Lonely Mountain.\t\n10\tYou should gather your allies and undertake Gimli's quests to aid Dale and the Lonely Mountain.\t\n11\tYou should gather your allies and undertake Gimli's quests to aid Dale and the Lonely Mountain.\t\n12\tTalk to Elrond at the Last Homely House in Rivendell\tMaster Elrond is at the Last Homely House in Rivendell. You should return to Master Elrond and tell him your tale.\n13\tTalk to Gandalf the Grey at the Last Homely House in Rivendell\tGandalf the Grey is at the Last Homely House in Rivendell. Elrond told you to bring your tidings to Gandalf the Grey.\n",
[12899]="70062DDE\n1\tLook for dangers to Herne at the western cross-road\030Find the cross-road west of Herne\030Look for dangers to Herne at the northern cross-road\030Find the cross-road north-west of Herne\tBrioc asked you to look for threats to Herne at two cross-roads near the town: one to the west, and one to the north.\n2\tTalk to Brioc in Herne\tBrioc is in the northern reaches of the town of Herne, waiting for your report.\n",
[12900]="700571C1\n1\tDefeat Gundabad pack-leaders (total: 4)\030Defeat Gundabad pack-hunters (total: 8)\tGundabad pack-leaders and Gundabad pack-hunters can be found in the Floodfells. You should defeat the Gundabad pack-leaders and Gundabad pack-hunters.\n",
[12901]="700453EB\n1\tWoses can be found in Drû Bhûta. You should show off you laugh to the Woses.\t\n2\tSpeak with Ôk-weni-Dhûr\tÔk-weni-Dhûr is in Drû Bhûta. You should speak with Ôk-weni-Dhûr.\n3\tListen to the laugh of the Woses\tÔk-weni-Dhûr is in Drû Bhûta. You should listen to the laugh of the Woses.\n4\tSpeak with Ôk-weni-Dhûr\tÔk-weni-Dhûr is in Drû Bhûta. You should speak with Ôk-weni-Dhûr.\n",
[12902]="7005BE91\n1\tDefeat Stormbár\030Defeat snow-beasts in Grymmclúd (total: 10)\tA pack of snow-beasts has been discovered in Grymmclúd, near the Clovengate. You should defeat snow-beasts and their pack-leader, Stormbár, in Grymmclúd.\n2\tTalk to Kyrstig\tKyrstig can be found near Ibdêkh-buzru, the Thing-fold. You should talk to Kyrstig.\n",
[12903]="7000A11A\n1\tDefeat tomb-robbers at Barad Tharsír (total: 8)\030Defeat Ansley Atwood\030Defeat Ogden Oakes\tBarad Tharsír is located south-east of Tinnudir, in the Barandalf, on the far side of the Brandywine. Unity Tilden has asked you to defeat members of the robber-band that has taken Barad Tharsír, as well as their most infamous members: Ansley Atwood and Ogden Oakes.\n2\tTalk to Unity Tilden\tUnity Tilden is at the Ranger camp on the island of Tinnudir, north-west of the Barandalf and west of Parth Aduial. Unity is waiting to hear that you have defeated the robbers at Barad Tharsír.\n",
[12904]="70025C9D\n1\tAid Eliot Bencroft in Rantost\030Aid Leighton Kipps in Rantost\030Aid Wal Simpkins in Rantost\tThere are several things to be done around Rantost to disturb the tomb-robbers operations.\n2\tTalk to Eliot Bencroft at Rantost\tEliot Bencroft is at the south-east corner of Rantost. Eliot Bencroft will want to hear that Rantost has been weakened to the point of being open to a larger assault.\n",
[12905]="70067314\n1\tTalk to Raghda-gûn\tItho has asked you to steal a roc's egg, a most heinous act. You should warn any rocs you find. Rocs may found at Aklâradum, a cliff south of Halrax.\n",
[12906]="70015E0E\n1\tDestroy the roosting tree\tThe crebain's roosting tree lies in the valley to the east of Gwingris. Thaliondir has asked you to burn down the roosting tree of the crebain.\n2\tTalk to Thaliondir at Gwingris\tThaliondir is at Gwingris, west of the roosting tree. You should return to Thaliondir with news of your success.\n",
[12907]="7000F0BE\n1\tDefeat Ringdagnir\tRingdagnir can be found on the westside of the hot springs near Zigilgund. Weth has asked you to defeat the great winter-worm Ringdagnir.\n2\tTalk to Weth\tWeth can be found in Zigilgund, south of the thermal vents. You have defeated the great worm Ringdagnir. Weth will be pleased with you.\n",
[12908]="7002844E\n1\tExamine the Uruks' orders (quantity: see journal)\tThe tent of the Uruk-commander lies somewhere in the Vale below Quickbeam's home. You should search for orders in the tent of the Uruk-commander.\n2\tDefeat the Uruk-commander (quantity: see journal)\tThe Uruk-commander is at his tent. You have been discovered by the Uruk-commander.\n3\tBring the Uruks' orders to Quickbeam\tQuickbeam is at his home upon the north-eastern slopes above Nan Curunír. You should bring the Uruks' orders to Quickbeam.\n",
[12909]="7002CE2E\n1\tDiscover the roots of Fangorn\tThickbark has asked you to gather your fellowship and explore the interior of the caves that stretch beneath the Limlight Falls. These caves can be found a short way from the Limlight Glade, on the western side of the river.\n2\tProtect the roots of Fangorn\tYou have discovered a band of Orcs in the lower stretches of the cavern. You must locate their leader and defeat him in battle in order to drive the rest from the caverns.\n",
[12910]="7007179C\n1\tKill blighted spiders (total: 6)\030Kill blighted Huorns (total: 4)\030Destroy blighted spider eggs (total: 8)\tSpiders and Huorns in the area are threatening Laivárth. Tálbiral has asked you to thin their numbers and destroy any blighted spider eggs you find.\n2\tReturn to Tálbiral in Laivárth\tReturn to Tálbiral and inform him that you have reduced the number of spiders and Huorns threatening Laivárth.\n",
[12911]="70042890\n1\tSpeak with Cánnakh\tCánnakh can be found in Aughaire. You should speak with Cánnakh.\n2\tSpeak with Cánnakh\tCánnakh can be found in Aughaire. You should speak with Cánnakh.\n",
[12912]="70042F71\n1\tSpeak with Nanoth\tNanoth can be found in Bâr Húrin. You should speak with Nanoth.\n2\tSpeak with Nanoth\tNanoth can be found in Bâr Húrin. You should speak with Nanoth.\n",
[12913]="70043C5C\n1\tSpeak with Brangil\tBrangil can be found in Tinnudir. You should speak with Brangil.\n2\tSpeak with Brangil\tBrangil can be found in Tinnudir. You should speak with Brangil.\n",
[12914]="70042899\n1\tSpeak with Ostasänt\tOstasänt can be found in Sûri-kylä. You should speak with Ostasänt.\n2\tSpeak with Ostasänt\tOstasänt can be found in Sûri-kylä. You should speak with Ostasänt.\n",
[12915]="70043C5E\n1\tSpeak with Gellamiel\tGellamiel can be found in Ost Galadh. You should speak with Gellamiel.\n2\tSpeak with Gellamiel\tGellamiel can be found in Ost Galadh. You should speak with Gellamiel.\n",
[12916]="70043C5D\n1\tSpeak with Othwen\tOthwen can be found in Esteldín. You should speak with Othwen.\n2\tSpeak with Othwen\tOthwen can be found in Esteldín. You should speak with Othwen.\n",
[12917]="70042895\n1\tAelnir can be found in Dol Amroth. You should speak with Aelnir.\t\n2\tSpeak with Aelnir\tAelnir can be found in Dol Amroth. You should speak with Aelnir.\n",
[12918]="7003A67A\n1\tCollect boar hides (total: 4)\tBoars can be found throughout the Eastfold. Thane Sparhafoc asked you to collect boar-hides so that he might make a new banner for Guthláf.\n2\tTalk to Thane Sparhafoc\tThane Sparhafoc is in the Mead Hall of Fenmarch. You have collected enough boar-hides for Thane Sparhafoc to make a banner for his son, Guthláf, and should now deliver them to him.\n",
[12919]="70062126\n1\tDefeat moorland howlers (total: 8)\030Defeat moorland slinkers (total: 4)\030Defeat the moorland pack-leader\tMaddoc has asked you lessen the number of wolves who den at Wylvenclove, north of Herne. Wylvenclove is in western Cardolan.\n2\tReturn to Maddoc\tYou should let Maddoc know you have defeated many of the vicious wolves who lived near Herne. Maddoc is inside the Inn at Herne.\n",
[12920]="7004356A\n1\tDefeat the Haradrim Captain Jukotor\030Defeat the maddened troll, Thrug\030Pursue the mysterious stranger\tFollow the mysterious figure.\n2\tDefeat the Cargûl Lúmithil\tThe mysterious figure has been revealed to be the Ranger Lúmithil, stabbed with a Morgul-blade and changed into a Cargûl.\n",
[12921]="70043568\n1\tDefeat the Haradrim Captain Jukotor\030Defeat the maddened troll, Thrug\030Pursue the mysterious stranger\tFollow the mysterious figure.\n2\tDefeat the Cargûl Lúmithil\tThe mysterious figure has been revealed to be the Ranger Lúmithil, stabbed with a Morgul-blade and changed into a Cargûl.\n",
[12922]="70042EA6\n1\tEnter the ruins of Brangobel\tThe ruins of Brangobel are located north-east of Bâr Húrin. You should enter Brangobel, where Thurindol asked you to bury some supplies for a forward base.\n2\tDefeat Orc spies (total: 4)\tThe ruins of Brangobel are located north-east of Bâr Húrin. You should defeat Orc spies at Brangobel so that it is clear to bury the supplies for Thurindol.\n3\tBury Ranger supplies (total: 6)\tThe ruins of Brangobel are located north-east of Bâr Húrin. You should bury Ranger supplies at Brangobel.\n4\tCompleted\tBuried Ranger supplies.\n",
[12923]="700606E9\n1\tDefeat enemies at Eitheldir (total: 10)\030Defeat Eitheldir's captain\tEitheldir is in the northern Angle. You should defeat enemies in Eitheldir.\n2\tReturn to Merileg\tMerileg is located on the road to Eitheldir, in the northern Angle. You should return to Merileg.\n",
[12924]="70008142\n1\tSearch for the missing relics\tLooters may have stashed the missing relics throughout Minas Vrûn, in western Annúndir. You should search Minas Vrûn for the missing relics, in case the looters buried them for later recovery.\n2\tLooters may have stashed the missing relics throughout Minas Vrûn, in western Annúndir. You should search Minas Vrûn for the missing relics, in case the looters buried them for later recovery.\t\n3\tBring the statue's relics to Amarion\tAmarion is at Amon Raith. You should bring the relics you found to Amarion.\n",
[12925]="70015E37\n1\tSearch rubble (total: 8)\tThere are many rubble piles in Pembar, north-east of Echad Eregion. Faenhilith has asked you to search the rubble piles at Pembar to see if you can learn what interest the minions of Saruman have there.\n2\tTalk to Faenhilith at Echad Eregion\tFaenhilith is at Echad Eregion, south-west of Pembar. You should return to Faenhilith and let her know what you found at Pembar.\n",
[12926]="70062133\n1\tLook for tracks near the trough outside of Hulfryn's house\tThe last thing the missing sheep did before fleeing was eat from the trough outside Hulfryn's house. You should check the area near it for tracks.\n2\tExamine the sheep hoof-prints\tYou have noticed faint hoof-prints near the trough outside Hulfryn's house. You should examine them.\n3\tFollow the hoof-print trail\tThe hoof-print trail leads north-west out of Herne. You should follow it.\n4\tExamine the blood\tThe hoof-print trail you'd been following ended abruptly at a pool of blood. You should examine the blood.\n5\tFollow the blood splatters\tA trail of blood splatters continues north. You should follow it.\n6\tExamine the dead sheep\tYou've unfortunately found Hulfryn's last sheep. You should examine its corpse.\n7\tTalk to Hulfryn in Herne\tYou have defeated the wight that killed Hulfryn's sheep. You should return to Herne and tell him.\n",
[12927]="7005A678\n1\tTalk to Varthmath near Ronglagam\tVarthmath can be found near Ronglagam in Máttugard. You should talk to Varthmath near Ronglagam.\n2\tTalk to Varthmath at Zidir-nesad\tZidir-nesad, the Steepset can be found in the western part of Máttugard. You should talk to Varthmath at Zidir-nesad.\n3\tTalk to Voina at Zidir-nesad\tZidir-nesad, the Steepset can be found in the western part of Máttugard. You should talk to Voina at Zidir-nesad.\n",
[12928]="70065B4A\n1\tDefeat Ruthless Dead (total: 12)\030Defeat Ruthless Dead berserkers (total: 2)\tA battle-worn soldier has offered you the chance to defeat the Ruthless Dead in the Ruins of Ethillorn, south of Linhir. Defeat the Ruthless Dead.\n2\tTalk to the battle-worn soldier outside the Ruins of Ethillorn\tYou have defeated many of the Ruthless Dead, and should report to the battle-worn soldier standing outside the Ruins of Ethilllorn south of Linhir. Talk to the soldier outside the Ruins of Ethillorn.\n",
})
